{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57135","headline":"行路难二十篇（幷序） 第十七章明法性平等 · 傅翕","name":"行路难二十篇（幷序） 第十七章明法性平等","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见法性无知不可说，有漏无漏幷虚通。\n虽复乖差作诸地，寻其本际尽皆同。\n亦复无同可同法，亦不以空持作宗。\n若欲知斯殊妙道，但自穷搜五阴丛。\n如实无来亦无去，亦不的在六情中。\n即是无原真法界，湛然常存无始终。\n行路难，路难苦乐何未央。\n时往西方无量寿，或复托化现东方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}